From 24f2b4fa55f840228b5482f682ef5c291cdd46a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:09:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MENU15 + NOOVERLAP-1 (web): Tools/Config/Debug menus x1.5;
 Motor Test overlaps removed

EastSun 20260930: the menu buttons are too small, enlarge everything 1.5x
(Tools and the other menus too); and overlapping controls are not allowed.
- main.html: the three drop-down menus scale by --smz 1.5 (item 186x44,
  font 16.5px, icons 21px); explicit sizes, not CSS zoom, because
  toggleMenu() keeps the menu on screen with offsetLeft/offsetWidth.
  Debug menu: two columns sized to the text (long Chinese names).
- HW.MotorTest.html: "Write back Mot_Table" moved from top 44 to 84 (it
  covered "Torque : x %"); the torque note wraps inside 112px instead of
  running past Panel4; radio groups use 12px radios / 13px lines so "All"
  stays inside the 57x49 "select" box.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/HW.MotorTest.html |  9 +++++++--
 page/main.html         | 11 +++++++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/page/HW.MotorTest.html b/page/HW.MotorTest.html
index cda1811..7b07dcc 100644
--- a/page/HW.MotorTest.html
+++ b/page/HW.MotorTest.html
@@ -32,6 +32,10 @@
   .pnl{box-sizing:border-box;}
   .pnlCap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:2px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;white-space:pre;overflow:hidden;}
   .rgi{display:block;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;}
+  /* AI(W906-NOOVERLAP) 20260930：EastSun「很多頁面都有重疊的情況 這是不被允許的」—— select（57x49）裡的「All」壓到框線：
+     瀏覽器預設 radio 是 13px＋上 3px 邊界，兩行塞不進 33px 內框。改成跟 .ckb 一樣的緊湊排法（12px 圓鈕、13px 行高）。 */
+  .rg .rgi{display:flex;align-items:center;line-height:13px;}
+  .rg .rgi input{flex:none;margin:0 4px 0 1px;width:12px;height:12px;}
   /* flex 垂直置中 + 緊湊行高：dfm Height=15 的 checkbox 文字下緣才不會被裁掉 */
   .ckb{font-size:11px;white-space:pre;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;line-height:13px;}
   .ckb input{flex:none;margin:0 4px 0 1px;width:12px;height:12px;}
@@ -63,7 +67,7 @@
 </head>
